Thumbs.db

# Things Claude wrote for you to look at / hand-upload — not part of the site.
# (A real `git add` honours this file. The GitHub web UI's drag-and-drop does NOT —
#  it uploads whatever you drop, .gitignore and all. That is how a commit containing
#  the service-account keys gets attempted, and rejected.)
Claude outputs/
